{"id":"e666e28fc8018212","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-closure-operator.md","title":"Function Class Closure","display":"df-closure-operator — Function Class Closure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-closure-operator","aliases":["90-df-closure-operator"],"display":"df-closure-operator — Function Class Closure","depends_on":["[[90-df-omega]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-closure-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-closure-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-closure-operator — Function Class Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9846c377383d14c1\" href=\"?note=9846c377383d14c1\" title=\"90-df-omega\">90-df-omega</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>自然数集见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9846c377383d14c1\" href=\"?note=9846c377383d14c1\" title=\"90-df-omega\">90-df-omega</a>；函数以其有定义域的图表示，有限列采用集合论有限列。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span> 是下式定义的全部有限元数值全函数的集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\mathcal F\">\\(B\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal F^{\\mathcal F^n}\">\\(O\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal F^{\\mathcal F^n}\\)</span> 为参数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Closure}\">\\(\\mathrm{Closure}\\)</span> 是下式定义的闭包算子。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal F\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Closure}(B,O)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{C\\subseteq\\mathcal F:B\\subseteq C\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall op\\in O\\cap\\mathcal F^{\\mathcal F^n}\\\n\\forall\\vec g\\in C^n\\ (op(\\vec g)\\in C)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Closure}(B,O)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{C\\subseteq\\mathcal F:B\\subseteq C\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall op\\in O\\cap\\mathcal F^{\\mathcal F^n}\\\n\\forall\\vec g\\in C^n\\ (op(\\vec g)\\in C)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Closure}(B, O)\">\\(\\mathrm{Closure}(B, O)\\)</span>: 从基础集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 通过运算集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\">\\(O\\)</span> 生成的最小闭包</li>\n<li>满足：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B \\subseteq \\mathrm{Closure}(B, O)\">\\(B \\subseteq \\mathrm{Closure}(B, O)\\)</span> 且对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\">\\(O\\)</span> 中运算闭合</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a> — 原始递归函数</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"9846c377383d14c1","anchor":"ref-1","target